ok   generate attachment writes the migration and the app test, and edits the rest
ok   the migration adds the five NOT NULL columns with '' and 0 as not attached
ok   the model block is inserted after the class line with prefixed names and callbacks
ok   the controller gets the download action and the file assignment in create and update
ok   the route is added before the resource
ok   the form is multipart with a file input, and the show page shows the image
ok   the .gitignore of a new app ignores the uploads
ok   the generated test covers the security behaviour
ok   no generator writes test/support/app_test.rb
